{
 "source": "Hand-derived lineage and impact cases from an external audit of master 9df1c461 (S013). Each case gives the SQL, the expected one-hop value lineage (filter, join and correlation keys are reads, not value sources; a physical STRUCT column is traced to its root) and every column the SQL reads. `finding_family` names the defect a case reproduced before the fix.",
